          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Validate webhook payloads against trigger schemas**\n\nFor every webhook, the required `Trigger.schema` is never parsed here; the raw or transformed object is passed directly to `trigger.handler`. A signed but malformed provider payload therefore bypasses the declared Zod contract and commonly fails later with a `TypeError` or reaches permissive handlers with invalid fields instead of returning the intended deterministic validation error. Parse the transformed payload with the trigger schema before dispatch.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
