      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Reclaim sync jobs abandoned in running state**\n\nIf a sync worker exits after this query changes a queued job to `running`, every later `processQueued()` call searches only for `queued` jobs, so the job remains stuck forever. The stored worker claim timestamp is never used as a lease cutoff; include stale `running` jobs in the claim candidates and use a conditional update to reclaim them safely.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
