      "html_url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/103#discussion_r3810280006",
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Persist Outlook delta and subscription state durably**\n\nThese module-local stores are emptied on process restart and are not shared between application instances, although Graph subscriptions remain active remotely. Consequently, `mail.subscription.handlePush` fails with `subscription state not found for connection` on another instance, and incremental syncs without an explicitly supplied checkpoint fail after restart; wire these actions to configured durable storage rather than singleton memory stores.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
